+/// With the small-hole rule off, the 10 x 10 hole is cut counter-clockwise
+/// with arc leads. A lead-in to its corner comes out of the part.
+#[test]
+fn a_pick_whose_pierce_falls_on_the_part_is_refused_by_name() {
